OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine and then dry
OL,7,Fovernight with prolonged clear periods
OL,8,Fand small amounts of cloud. Staying
OL,9,Frather warm in urban areas but cooler
OL,10,Fin the countryside by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FDry with lots of strong
OL,13,Fsunshine, temperatures rising rapidly
OL,14,Fduring the morning. High level cloud
OL,15,Fwill make the skies a little hazy at
OL,16,Ftimes. Feeling widely hot, locally
OL,17,Fvery hot.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
