OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FHot
OL,6,For very hot with temperatures peaking
OL,7,Fon Thursday with plenty of strong
OL,8,Fsunshine. Similar on Friday, with
OL,9,Ffresher conditions and cloudier
OL,10,Fconditions by Saturday.
